### ==============================================================================
### CROWDFUNDING & SOCIAL CAMPAIGNS APIS
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. List All Active Campaigns
GET {{baseUrl}}/campaigns

### 2. Create Campaign (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mission Shiksha - Free Coaching for Rural Youth",
  "titleHi": "मिशन शिक्षा - ग्रामीण युवाओं के लिए निःशुल्क कोचिंग",
  "description": "Providing quality educational resources, books, and competitive exam mentors for underprivileged youth in Uttar Pradesh.",
  "descriptionHi": "उत्तर प्रदेश के वंचित युवाओं के लिए गुणवत्तापूर्ण पुस्तकें और प्रतियोगी परीक्षा मार्गदर्शन उपलब्ध कराना।",
  "category": "Youth Education",
  "goalAmount": 150000,
  "bannerImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497633762265-9d179a990aa6?w=600",
  "urgent": true
}

### 3. Update Campaign
PUT {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/CAMPAIGN_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raisedAmount": 25000,
  "donorCount": 12
}

### 4. Delete Campaign
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/CAMPAIGN_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
